# Minimal .dockerignore — only exclude what's absolutely necessary.
#
# The web-ui image is built with context `apps/web-ui` (see
# scripts/deploy-adhoc-dev.sh in emergent.memory.infra), NOT the repo root, so
# Docker reads THIS file, not ../.dockerignore.
#
# Excluding node_modules is load-bearing. Local dev symlinks
# `gateway/node_modules` -> a checked-out go-daisy clone (see .gitignore). The
# Dockerfile's `RUN npm ci` creates /src/node_modules as a real directory, and
# the subsequent `COPY gateway/ ./` would otherwise copy that symlink onto it,
# failing the build with:
#   "cannot replace to directory .../src/node_modules with file"
.git
.DS_Store
node_modules
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
__pycache__
*.pyc
dist
build
